+## Palette freeze (2026-08-22, #1245)
+
+**Decision: freeze this library as a historical generation record.**
+
+The catalog's `palette.rocket_orange` (`#ef8b39`) and the locked `style_suffix`
+that embeds it are the prompts that produced the existing session imagery.
+They are **not** rewritten to ATA's later accent (`#b93800`, as in
+`public/brand/allthingsai-favicon.svg`) because that would make the library
+describe images that were never generated from it.
+
+- Do not update `#ef8b39` in place in this file.
+- Do not treat this file as the live ATA brand token source.
+- When a future generation wave needs the new accent, add a **new** versioned
+  catalog (or regenerate assets under new prompts) rather than mutating this
+  one. The ConferenceOS product default accent in `src/lib/theme.ts` /
+  `--color-rocket-400` remains a separate matter and is unchanged by this
+  freeze.
+
 The server-only loader in `src/lib/session-images/catalog.ts` validates the
 entire catalog before returning it. Validation covers the declared count,
 stable IDs and filenames, canonical track names, 20 slots per track, bounded
